<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-7/8 (FIM 188.13) - SEPT 5.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-7/8 (FIM 188.13) - SEPT 5.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-1/2 hihger at $41-7/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 188.13 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday Nokia closed down 0.70 markka at 185.80.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) were unchtraded on Wall Street overnight. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.10 markka at 75.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was also untraded in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 2.80 markka higher at 97.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
